B0C4C9D"}, "display_name": "Douyin VR Live", "keywords": [], "long_description": "1. Choices Abound: Enjoy trending streaming content at your fingertips with various streaming categories, including Talents, Gaming, Virtual Idol, Outdoors and Positive Vibes. \n2. New Experiences: See and hear content like never before with immersive and large-screen Douyin VR streaming. \n3. New Interactions: Get ready for the awesome experience of hand-giving a 3D gift, and watch your favorite streamers face off in intense PK battles up close on the big virtual screen for a comprehensively upgraded interactive experience.", "short_description": "Douyin VR Live is a next-generation VR user-facing streaming platform that is committed to bringing you an exhilarating and immersive interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logozh.png", "id": "1439261319980082", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75441583_1439261323313415_6105103478412624436_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dXgdP2q__bMQ7kNvwEMRpoa&_nc_oc=AdpLm8JFMJeJ6gXTUSmQdCzv4QySxirnkSYWv-MirS0ebBt7acOO7QOAd3rGZ7FzrZk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRmmeKOxy6G8_AMh_x9uQoKyULAYEKNJ5J2TCOtAFksig&oe=6B0C71DC"}, {"file_name": "2560 x 1440.png", "id": "1222877525073722", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982446_1222877528407055_8056433039736167714_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LRjQbJYpGUsQ7kNvwGuyUv_&_nc_oc=Ado-ySSKqPqZnUCQiulOV7MBrIMzaEw-bvBPX5KZa3ZQhNXwXn7ylMJ2vNAcBsrYz4o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT7UuWQmV5ET8FtmDW3VfYeIJoza8P40iKUW7IRvApXQw&oe=6B0C6CDC"}, {"file_name": "1440 x 1440.png", "id": "961925418233844", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036617_96192